SUMMARY:Highlight Tour: National Indigenous Peoples Day
DESCRIPTION:Highlight Tour: National Indigenous Peoples Day            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Sunday June 21\, 2026\n11:00 am – 12:00 pm\nIncluded with admission. No registration necessary \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Come visit with and learn about the Indigenous works and makers showcased throughout the Museum. On this tour led by a member of our Education team\, we’ll share information about the new Indigenous Immemorial gallery and the ways in which it focuses on community-centred stories. Join us for National Indigenous Peoples Day and celebrate the vibrant the legacy of making on Turtle island since time immemorial. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/highlight-tour-national-indigenous-peoples-day/
